sers/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on the MRP, it works as expected. Code looks good to me. I agree we should have a compatibility setting for this, but it's fine to have this new scaling enabled by default.\r\n\r\nHowever, on the [MSDF Font](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/msdf_font) demo, this does not seem to resolve the issue where a MSDF font has greater line spacing than the same font with traditional rendering:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dd83020-7125-4e28-bf44-497c3478b69e\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cb278d9-a864-4473-aaa4-0e2024cc6909\r\n\r\nI've also tested https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123159 and it didn't resolve this particular issue for me.\r\n\r\nI guess this is what this quote in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123159 refers to:\r\n\r\n> So there's one remaining issue not addressed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115 nor this PR, which is that depending on the MSDF size property, the vertical position of the glyph still changes significantly. I'm not aware of a bug report for it though.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#pullrequestreview-5115034866","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123115","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#pullrequestreview-5115034866"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123115"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-04T15:39:26Z","commit_id":"f4d0606c5c496cb85ccb99efb3d74b0d3ae592bb"}]